# YouTube Cookies Example File
#
# Vidi COOKIES_INSTRUCTIONS.md za puno uputstvo.
#
# Brzo:
#   yt-dlp --cookies-from-browser chrome --cookies cookies.txt "https://www.youtube.com"
# Zatim na serveru mountuj: -v ~/cookies.txt:/app/cookies.txt:ro
#
# NEVER commit the actual cookies.txt file to git!
#
# Format: Netscape HTTP Cookie File (automatically generated by yt-dlp)
